}
```
For Bruno/Tito/Priya etc. Priya starts idle. Face maybe role-specific? Base look has flip; we'll default `face=1`, but drawStaff will use state.face. For fixed roles, we want original look flip: set `face = id==='bruno' ? -1 : 1` maybe. For Tito/flip look currently -1. Set face = look? Could set makeCrewState by id map: `{bea:1,tito:-1,priya:1,bruno:-1,mara:-1,eli:1}`. Use defaults.
- For walking, face updates; when idle, preserves last direction.
- For Tito behind counter, face 1 maybe facing left? original -1. Keep -1? Since customers at right/queue? Counter x, queue x-.2..+1.8, y+1.15. Tito behind at x-.15,y-.78, screen relative; front is +y. Facing camera. Flip doesn't matter. Use -1 as original.
- For Bruno at door, face -1 original. Good.

`updateCrew(dt,p)` calls ensure and then `stepWorker` for each. Need skip movement when game is paused? Renderer still draws while paused; workers maybe should freeze? UI pause happens on modal; game doesn't update but rendering still. Could animate crew anyway; it's fine, but jobs queued? If pause, game events don't fire, existing steps continue. Acceptable. Could gate on `game.runtime.uiPaused`? Not necessary, but animating while paused (modal) is decorative. fine.

Artifact cleanup:
```
  cleanupCrewArtifacts(p) {
    for (const key of [...this.hiddenPlants]) {
      const [propId,idxStr]=key.split(':'); const idx=+idxStr;
      const ps=this.game.state.properties[propId];
      if (propId!==p.id || !ps?.slots[idx]) this.hiddenPlants.delete(key);
    }
