```
When hidden plant pending and game slot occupied, keeps. When null (harvested before Eli arrives) delete. Good.
For trim ghost, if game slot null then keep; if slot exists (replanted) delete. If same strain newly planted before ghost removal, condition not delete; but pot now occupied, draw ghost vs game? In draw we should only use ghost if slot is null. So leftover ghost invisible; cleanup eventually should remove if slot exists regardless. Do `if (ps?.slots[idx]) delete` (any slot). Good.
