  stepTo(st,target,speed,dt) {...}
  jobApproach(p,index,id) {...}
  crewSpotClear(p, spot, index) {...}
  slotApproachOffsets...
  updatePriya...
  emitCrewWorkParticles...
```

Need avoid using reserved method names. Fine.

Let's be precise.

