    if (st.id === 'priya') { this.stepInspector(st,p,dt); return; }
    if (st.phase === 'walk') { ... }
    else if (st.phase === 'work') { ... }
    else if (st.phase === 'rest') { ... }
    else if (st.phase === 'return') { ... }
    else { idle }
```
For `walk` when no job (returning home via phase walk from hire?) we use return for home. But initial state idle.
