```
But propState is active, and job propId matches active. If slot null, cancel without effect. Similarly plant job: slot should exist; if null, cancel (maybe harvest happened). Trim job: ghost can be gone if property changed (states cleared), or slot maybe replanted; still trim animation at pot isn't harmful. Keep.
