- `rest`: timer-- then if queue start, else return.
- `idle`: timer--; if queue start; else if timer<=0 maybe stroll? For bea/mara/eli user asked them take to pots for jobs; idle at home is fine. But idle forever if no auto jobs? Auto timers always run if hired. Good.
